---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="页面不存在" description="找不到你要访问的页面。">
  <section class="not-found">
    <p class="eyebrow"><span></span>404 / Not found</p>
    <h1>这条索引<br />还没有建立。</h1>
    <p>链接可能已经移动，或者这篇笔记仍在整理中。</p>
    <a class="text-link" href="/notes/">返回全部笔记 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
